From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx11_43: thread pump, async processors, load info, mip chains and texture operations (3593)

d3dx11_43: thread pump, async processors, load info, mip chains and texture operations

D3DX11CreateThreadPump and the D3DX11CreateAsync{TextureInfo,Texture,ShaderResourceView,
Compiler,ShaderPreprocess}Processor exports exist; the compile, preprocess, image
info, texture and shader resource view loaders run through a pump; load info
is honoured (size, format, usage, bind and access flags, mip chains including
block compressed formats, volume textures, arrays); D3DX11FilterTexture,
D3DX11LoadTextureFromTexture and D3DX11SaveTextureTo{File,Memory} work. d3dx11_42
exports follow.
